  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Uganda, Malawi. The objective of the project is to strengthen each other&apos;s organisation as regional development partners through vocational skills and entrepreneurship. The educational institutions are aiming to be leading providers of quality technical vocational skills training and facilitators for entrepreneurship
in their recpective countries. High quality vocational skills education, strengthening partnership with local businesses, entrepreneurship training, increasing enrolment of girls in technical vocational education training, counselling and life skills are some of the areas of focus for the project.</narrative>
  </description>
